%% On-chain vs Off-chain Data Architecture
flowchart LR
subgraph OffChain[PostgreSQL — private operational data]
PII[PII, credentials hash, roles]
Apps[Applications, decisions, loan records]
Pays[Repayments, balances, references]
Meta[Event status, tx hash, failure metadata]
end
subgraph OnChain[Blockchain — minimal audit facts]
E[Loan opaque ID, event type, amount if applicable, timestamp, authorized caller]
end
Apps -. event projection .-> E
Pays -. event projection .-> E
Meta -. tx reference / confirmation .-> E
PII -. MUST NOT be sent .-> E
